	(text "BUS / 21 to the comparators (32 V -> 1.5 V, inside the LM393's input range\nat 3.3 V). Outputs are inverted: low while the bus is above the threshold.\nThresholds about 4.3 V (data) and 12.2 V (acknowledge), hysteresis about\n0.65 V at the bus. ALL VALUES PROVISIONAL until the scope measurement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4286c9f5-3ada-52cc-98cc-236a85c35596")
	)
	(text "The Arduino recipe: 200 R across the bus for the whole telegram (carrier),\n10 R during each 0 bit. The base pull-downs keep both off while the ESP32\nboots. The firmware must never leave them on: on an idle bus R20 alone\nwould draw 140 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 95.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6ba18471-9266-50e0-a4b9-0641b322e9f5")
	)
	(text "Data in"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7652470c-aa56-510e-be74-18eedcea4398")
	)
	(text "Test points"
